---
import { getEntry } from 'astro:content';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import Testimonials from '../components/Testimonials.astro';
import Logo from '../components/Logo.astro';
import { ABOUT } from '../data/about';
import { getPosts } from '../lib/posts';
import { person } from '../lib/schema';
const page = (await getEntry('pages', 'about-me'))!;
const essays = (await getPosts()).length;
---
<Page
  title="About"
  eyebrow="Marko Obranović"
  lede="Why astrology? Because I don't feel any borders in astrology."
  description="Marko Obranović – astrologer and author of Terra Astrology: astrology from a different perspective."
  jsonLd={person()}
>
  <section class="wrap section about">
    {ABOUT.photo ? (
      <img class="portrait" src={ABOUT.photo} alt="Marko Obranović" decoding="async" />
    ) : (
      <div class="emblem"><Logo size={200} title="Terra Astrology logo: an old lantern lit by the guiding star" /></div>
    )}
    <div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p class="big">
          This is just one approach on the subject without any intent to impose or convince. To understand it we
          need equally to learn and to forget what we were taught and above all we must learn to use our inner voice.
        </p>
        {ABOUT.bio.map((p) => <p>{p}</p>)}
        <h2>Astrology from a different perspective</h2>
        <p>
          I perceive astrology as something closest to the category of art. Many people today will easily type a
          couple of basic data into an online program and get a horoscope — this is not astrology. Astrology is
          neither infinite memorising of catalogue data on Sun signs, aspects and houses, nor arrogant rising above
          society.
        </p>
        <p>
          Astrology is here to help us on the road, to lead us to think bigger thoughts, as Dane Rudhyar said. We
          ought to use it to the extent to which we are able to return the “gift” to society.
        </p>
        <h2>The journal</h2>
        <p>
          Since 2012 I have written {essays} essays on Terra Astrology — on the twelve signs and their myths, the
          planetary cycles, and the times we live in. Reading a few of them is the best way to see whether my
          approach suits what you are looking for.
        </p>
      </div>
      {ABOUT.facts.length > 0 && <ul class="facts">{ABOUT.facts.map((f) => <li>{f}</li>)}</ul>}
      <blockquote class="rudhyar">
        <p>
          “From the eternal and symbolical east the sun ever rises to bring to man the promise of fulfillment
          through embodied existence. This is the gift of the Constellations to humanity: that Man-the-Spirit may
          prove and fulfill himself in man-the-personality.”
        </p>
        <footer>— Dane Rudhyar</footer>
      </blockquote>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/consultations/">Consultations</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/journal/">Read the journal</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap section"><Testimonials /></section>
</Page>
<style>
  .about { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 340px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 72px); align-items: start; }
  .portrait { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; object-fit: cover; border-radius: var(--radius); box-shadow: var(--shadow); position: sticky; top: 100px; }
  .emblem { position: sticky; top: 100px; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--surface-2); display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--ink); }
  .emblem :global(svg) { width: 62%; height: auto; }
  .big { font-size: 1.2em; color: var(--ink); }
  .facts { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 32px 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
  .facts li { padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .rudhyar { margin: 40px 0; padding: 28px; border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--surface-2); font: italic 400 1.15rem/1.6 var(--font-text); max-width: var(--measure); }
  .rudhyar footer { font: 500 0.9rem var(--font-ui); color: var(--muted); margin-top: 10px; }
  .actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-ghost { color: var(--accent); }
  .section:has(> :empty) { display: none; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) { .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .portrait, .emblem { position: static; max-width: 300px; } }
</style>
